er","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6694362782,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLUK0B88AAAABjwPeng","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ubiquity-os-marketplace/text-conversation-rewards/labels/Priority:%201%20(Normal)","name":"Priority: 1 (Normal)","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-11-26T11:26:42Z","updated_at":"2025-12-22T06:49:50Z","closed_at":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"> 1. I think the generate-permit command is interesting and useful for ad-hoc payments. If it can be access controlled to only work for admins it could be nice to use.\n\nSince permits are always related to rewards or compensation in some form or another, and this is the only plugin in the eco-system with permit generating ability I think it makes sense to build it here. If it should be it's own plugin we can move this issue into `plugin-wishlist`.\n\n### Command\n\n``/generate-permit [githubUsername] [chainId | chainName] [amount] [tokenAddress | tokenSymbol]``\n\nThis structure makes things a bit easier for invokers of the command otherwise they must call `/query` first and then `/generate-permit` after finding the contributor's wallet addr\n\n- `githubUsername > githubId > supabase wallet`\n\nNote: maybe just `/permit`?\n\n### Access Control\n\nWe already have access control implemented for generating permits we can hook into that\n\n _Originally posted by @0x4007 in [#80](https://github.com/ubiquity-os/plugins-wishlist/issues/80#issuecomment-3580187899)_","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ubiquity-os-marketplace/text-conversation-rewards/issues/452/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ubiquity-os-marketplace/text-conversation-rewards/issues/452/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ubiquity-os-marketplace/daemon-task-matcher/issues/3","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ubiquity-os-marketplace/daemon-task-matcher","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ubiquity-os-marketplace/daemon-task-matcher/issues/3/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ubiquity-os-marketplace/daemon-task-matcher/issues/3/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ubiquity-os-marketplace/daemon-task-matcher/issues/3/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ubiquity-os-marketplace/daemon-task-matcher/issues/3","id":3900609346,"node_id":"I_kwDOQz-UVs7ofpNC","number":3,"title":"Improve confidence and matching","user":{"login":"gentlementlegen","id":9807008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4MDcwMDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9807008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentlementlegen","html_url":"https://github.com/gentlementlegen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentlementlegen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentlementlegen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentlementlegen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentlementlegen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentlementlegen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentlementlegen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentlementlegen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentlementlegen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentlementlegen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10140407312,"node_id":"